{"id":"46de5f0e3011160d","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-gauge-theory.md","title":"Parameterized Gauge-Theory Data","display":"df-gauge-theory — Parameterized Gauge-Theory Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-gauge-theory","aliases":["58-df-gauge-theory","Gauge Theory"],"display":"df-gauge-theory — Parameterized Gauge-Theory Data","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-principal-bundle.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-gauge-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-gauge-theory</span><span>Gauge Theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gauge-theory — Parameterized Gauge-Theory Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d5f05282b5c6816\" href=\"?note=5d5f05282b5c6816\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-principal-bundle.md\">../batch03/58-df-principal-bundle.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G\\in V\">\\(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G\\in V\\)</span> are principal-bundle data.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}},+_2,\\odot_2,d_{\\mathrm{ad}},[-,-]_{\\mathrm{ad}},F,\\mathcal E,S_{\\mathrm{YM}}\\in V\">\\(\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}},+_2,\\odot_2,d_{\\mathrm{ad}},[-,-]_{\\mathrm{ad}},F,\\mathcal E,S_{\\mathrm{YM}}\\in V\\)</span> are the chosen form carriers, linear operations, exterior derivative, bracket-wedge map, curvature map, energy map, and action.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are the predicates from the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GaugeTheoryData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GaugeTheoryData}_S\\)</span> is the fully parameterized predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gauge\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GaugeTheoryData}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G,\n\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}},+_2,\\odot_2,d_{\\mathrm{ad}},[-,-]_{\\mathrm{ad}},F,\\mathcal E,S_{\\mathrm{YM}})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_2,\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}\\times\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_2,\\mathbb R\\times\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}([-,-]_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}}\\times\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}})\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}}\\;\n\\bigl(F(A)=d_{\\mathrm{ad}}(A)+_2(\\tfrac12\\odot_2[A,A]_{\\mathrm{ad}})\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal E,\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S_{\\mathrm{YM}},\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}}\\;\n\\bigl(S_{\\mathrm{YM}}(A)=\\tfrac12\\mathcal E(F(A))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gauge\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GaugeTheoryData}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G,\n\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}},+_2,\\odot_2,d_{\\mathrm{ad}},[-,-]_{\\mathrm{ad}},F,\\mathcal E,S_{\\mathrm{YM}})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_2,\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}\\times\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_2,\\mathbb R\\times\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}([-,-]_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}}\\times\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}})\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}}\\;\n\\bigl(F(A)=d_{\\mathrm{ad}}(A)+_2(\\tfrac12\\odot_2[A,A]_{\\mathrm{ad}})\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal E,\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S_{\\mathrm{YM}},\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}}\\;\n\\bigl(S_{\\mathrm{YM}}(A)=\\tfrac12\\mathcal E(F(A))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The bundle topology, group action, form carriers, differential, bracket, curvature graph, and energy functional are explicit parameters. A Riemannian metric and volume form may be encoded in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E(\\omega)=\\int_M\\|\\omega\\|^2\\,d\\mathrm{vol}\">\\(\\mathcal E(\\omega)=\\int_M\\|\\omega\\|^2\\,d\\mathrm{vol}\\)</span> without being silently inferred from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-principal-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d5f05282b5c6816","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-principal-bundle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}},+_2,\\odot_2,d_{\\mathrm{ad}},[-,-]_{\\mathrm{ad}},F,\\mathcal E,S_{\\mathrm{YM}}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GaugeTheoryData}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gauge\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GaugeTheoryData}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G,\n\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}},+_2,\\odot_2,d_{\\mathrm{ad}},[-,-]_{\\mathrm{ad}},F,\\mathcal E,S_{\\mathrm{YM}})\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_2,\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}\\times\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_2,\\mathbb R\\times\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}([-,-]_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}}\\times\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}})\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}}\\;\n\\bigl(F(A)=d_{\\mathrm{ad}}(A)+_2(\\tfrac12\\odot_2[A,A]_{\\mathrm{ad}})\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal E,\\Omega^2_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S_{\\mathrm{YM}},\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}},\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in\\Omega^1_{\\mathrm{ad}}\\;\n\\bigl(S_{\\mathrm{YM}}(A)=\\tfrac12\\mathcal E(F(A))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal E(\\omega)=\\int_M\\|\\omega\\|^2\\,d\\mathrm{vol}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":2470,"backlinks":[{"id":"b1e779ca93eb771b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-573","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-gauge-theory.md|58-df-gauge-theory]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["5d5f05282b5c6816","36d7463d215be751"]}